import Tabs from '@theme/Tabs';
import TabItem from '@theme/TabItem';

> ### Note that this endpoint is only for transactions in the production environment
> Access to production must follow the authentication security requirements, including mTLS and IP allowlisting (required from February/2026 onward).
---
To get a transaction proof you can use the following endpoint

### Headers

| Name              | Description           |
| :---------------- | :-------------------- |
| x-delbank-api-key | **Required**. API key |
| x-delfinance-account-id | **Required**. The Delfinance bank account number |

<Tabs>
<TabItem value="json" label="CASH OUT">
```json
Get "https://api.delbank.com.br/baas/api/v1/pix/cashout/:End2Endid/proof"
```
</TabItem>
<TabItem value="text" label="CASH IN">
```json
Get "https://api.delbank.com.br/baas/api/v1/pix/cashin/:End2Endid/proof"
```
</TabItem>
</Tabs>
## Response
On a successful request here's what you will receive, only difference is it will be filled out with the relevant information:

![](img/image.png)